<title>FRANCE: Single currency to be engine for Europe - Juppe.</title>
<headline>Single currency to be engine for Europe - Juppe.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Europe's single currency will be a driving force in Europe's economy as other regions create trading blocs, French Prime Minister Alain Juppe said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;While North America has NAFTA, and South America has Mercosur and Asia has ASEAN, would we let the European Union split apart or weaken?,&quot; he said in an address to the national assembly.</p>
<p>&quot;Economic and monetary union and the single currency will be, I am sure, the engine of the Europe which we need,&quot; he said in the speech, given before a vote of confidence which the centre-right is considered certain to win.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
</text>
